<section class="mrk-inner-page"><div class="mrk-inner-hero"><div class="mrk-container"><span class="mrk-eyebrow">HELP CENTER</span><h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1><p>Common questions about MRK services, products, delivery and project inquiries.</p></div></div><div class="mrk-section"><div class="mrk-container mrk-faq"><details open><summary>Can I buy a service through the store?</summary><p>Yes. A service can be created as a Shopify product with a package price, scope and delivery details. Customers can then review the offer and use the available checkout flow.</p></details><details><summary>Do you provide custom website development?</summary><p>Yes. Custom requirements can be discussed before selecting or creating a suitable service package.</p></details><details><summary>What digital products can I sell?</summary><p>Templates, design resources, documents, project files, website packages, educational resources and other legitimate downloadable products can be offered according to the store setup.</p></details><details><summary>How should I prepare a project inquiry?</summary><p>Share the required service, project goal, important features, deadline, budget range if known, and any reference files or websites.</p></details><details><summary>Will this website automatically earn from Google?</summary><p>No. The theme is structured for SEO and content publishing, but traffic, original useful content, technical SEO, eligibility and platform policies determine whether advertising or search traffic produces revenue.</p></details><details><summary>Can I add more products myself?</summary><p>Yes. Products can be added and managed from Shopify Admin, including title, price, images, description, inventory or digital-delivery setup as applicable.</p></details></div></div><div class="mrk-section mrk-section-alt"><div class="mrk-container"><div class="mrk-cta"><div><span class="mrk-kicker mrk-kicker-light">READY</span><h2>Have a requirement?</h2><p>Browse a package or contact MRK with your project details.</p></div><a class="mrk-btn mrk-btn-primary" href="/pages/contact-mrk">Contact MRK</a></div></div></div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"MRK FAQ","settings":[]}{% endschema %}